date-released: 2026-09-27
url: "https://github.com/PeaBrane/nishimori-boundaries"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PeaBrane/nishimori-boundaries"
abstract: >-
  Programs, frozen inputs and certified outputs behind the computer-assisted statements of
  Vertical and reentrant ferromagnetic boundaries below the Nishimori point: the accumulation
  certificate of the Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model, the p = 3 and p = 4 certificates, the
  triple-point certificates for 3 <= p <= 25 and for large p, and the certified inputs of the
  decorated-lattice theorem.
